{"id":"vod_zy360_75054","vodId":"75054","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"无职转生：到了异世界就拿出真本事","name_cn":"无职转生：到了异世界就拿出真本事","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全11集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20250716-1/f45309fb3af6fa54c2f0e79d7d2ed36a.jpg"},"summary":"一场车祸夺走了34岁无业家里蹲男青年的生命，当他再度苏醒之后，震惊的发现自己竟然穿越到了异世界中，附身在了一位名为鲁迪乌斯（内山夕实配音）的贵族少爷身上。面对这命运之神给予他的重新来过的机会，男子发誓这一世一定要拿出点真本事来认真的生活。然而，尽管鲁迪乌斯有着这般宏达的决心，但废柴大叔的本性却还是屡屡暴露。沉默寡言的三无魔法师洛琪希（小原好美配音），个性软弱，因此想要学习魔法来自我保护的希露菲叶特（茅野爱衣配音），个性暴躁但体能超强的艾莉丝（加隈亚衣配音），和鲁迪乌斯一起在异世界里生活的，是这些可爱的女孩们。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2025-07-16 18:23:01","playable":true,"episodeCount":11,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/w6aCvkk5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/KYzjHdhS/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/Xx2vzaUj/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/WkByyX0k/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/upqsTibN/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/dHuiZu9p/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/K6LMnYkL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/HOjO5ZPA/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/6JwgO2x5/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/8np39Kdo/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://vod1.maowushi.com/20250716/lC8frkzR/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:40:51.286Z"}